v2.3 (2026-05-30)
-----------------
  * supply a default baud rate to remote pppd
  * find remote pppd from list of likely directories

v2.2 (2026-01-16)
-----------------
  * call waitpid to collect child processes in ssl-server mode
  * bundled libUseful is stored as libUseful-bundled to prevent any clashes with system-wide libUseful
  * map filepaths in home directory to ~/ so that configs can be copied system to system
 

v2.1 (2025-08-15)
-----------------
  * add -auth option to TLS server, enabling extra authentication schemes

v2.0 (2024-12-06)
-----------------
  * Handle SIGTTOU so program doesn't get frozen when run in background
  * Make supplying a CA file mandatory in server mode.
  * Add support for syslog logging, particularly for server mode.
  * Add '-ppp-speed' option to supply baud rate
  * Add '--version' option
  * Add CHANGELOG

v1.1 (2024-09-16)
-----------------
  * Minor documentation changes 


v1.0 (2024-09-16)
-------------------
  * Initial commit and first release
